  <name>Sound Recorder</name>
  <name xml:lang="pt">Gravador de som</name>
  <name xml:lang="pt-BR">Gravador de som</name>
  <summary>Record sound, see it, and play your audio files</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="pt">Grave som, veja-o e ouça os seus ficheiros de áudio</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="pt-BR">Grave som, veja-o e ouça seus arquivos de áudio</summary>
  <description>
    <p>A simple sound recorder and audio file player for the COSMIC™ desktop, built with libcosmic, that shows the sound as you record it and as you play it.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Record from any microphone, or from what the computer plays</li>
      <li>See the sound as you record, as a scrolling waveform or a spectrum</li>
      <li>Pause, resume, save or discard</li>
      <li>Browse your recordings and open WAV, FLAC, MP3, Ogg Vorbis, AAC/M4A, AIFF and CAF files</li>
      <li>Play them, with the whole waveform to click and drag through, and a live spectrum</li>
      <li>See their codec, sample rate, channels, bit depth and size; rename and delete them</li>
    </ul>
    <p xml:lang="pt">Um gravador de som simples para o ambiente COSMIC™, feito com a libcosmic.</p>
    <p xml:lang="pt-BR">Um gravador de som simples para o ambiente COSMIC™, feito com a libcosmic.</p>
  </description>
